# app-portage/bentoolkit defaults `browser` ON: the chromedp backend of its
# "script" version parser, which drives an installed Chrome/Chromium. In the
# base that meant compiling www-client/chromium -- and nodejs, gn, esbuild,
# simdjson -- into a console image, for one maintainer feature (measured
# 2026-09-26: 9 packages, chromium the longest build in Gentoo). Off here; a
# graphical layer that ships a browser can turn it back on.
app-portage/bentoolkit -browser
